(4998370, 729170, 96881, '<td valign="top">Photo seems only part of the picture here.  Everywhere I look something is cropped off.  Too m uch clutter that does not add to the picture.  Little emotion showed in it that portrays fun.  She could be doing homework byu the set up and her posture.</td>', 'Photo seems only part of the picture here.  Everywhere I look something is cropped off.  Too m uch clutter that does not add to the picture.  Little emotion showed in it that portrays fun.  She could be doing homework byu the set up and her posture.', '2008-10-08 02:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998373, 728705, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The expression on the face, with the toungue out is priceless (my dog does similar when really tired).<br/>The paw annoys me a little.  Its just hanging there.  Would have been great to tuck it up on the towel (but that may have distured your dog).  This also would have allowed you to keep more of the coat on its back in focus.<br/>However, still like it for the expression</td>', 'I like this.  The expression on the face, with the toungue out is priceless (my dog does similar when really tired).The paw annoys me a little.  Its just hanging there.  Would have been great to tuck it up on the towel (but that may have distured your dog).  This also would have allowed you to keep more of the coat on its back in focus.However, still like it for the expression', '2008-10-08 02:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998377, 729258, 96881, '<td valign="top">The rings at the feet give motion, without blur, and work really well.  The fog makes the back cliffs look really soft.  Would have been great with more fog but you can''t do much about that.  Great photo for the challenge</td>', 'The rings at the feet give motion, without blur, and work really well.  The fog makes the back cliffs look really soft.  Would have been great with more fog but you can''t do much about that.  Great photo for the challenge', '2008-10-08 02:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998379, 728927, 96881, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.  The orange drink ont he other side of the board would have been better, but unless you set this up, its hard to get them to move it.  Same goes with the women in the top left and the board, both of which you can''t get out of focus.  For an opportunistic shot, this has worked well.</td>', 'Like the idea.  The orange drink ont he other side of the board would have been better, but unless you set this up, its hard to get them to move it.  Same goes with the women in the top left and the board, both of which you can''t get out of focus.  For an opportunistic shot, this has worked well.', '2008-10-08 02:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998381, 729142, 96881, '<td valign="top">The lack of anything in the photo in focus is a problem.  Increase your shutter speed so that you can freeze then, as this is too blurred to work</td>', 'The lack of anything in the photo in focus is a problem.  Increase your shutter speed so that you can freeze then, as this is too blurred to work', '2008-10-08 02:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998384, 728574, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different idea, not sure about doing Black and white, when the colour of the hay and the clothes could have contrasted really well.  Shame about the girl on the right who addes clutter without any benifit.  A shot of just the boy on the left holding (about to throw) hay and the little boy int he middle would have been stunning</td>', 'Different idea, not sure about doing Black and white, when the colour of the hay and the clothes could have contrasted really well.  Shame about the girl on the right who addes clutter without any benifit.  A shot of just the boy on the left holding (about to throw) hay and the little boy int he middle would have been stunning', '2008-10-08 02:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998386, 728996, 96881, '<td valign="top">The posed snapshot does not really jump out at me saying Fun.  The space with the Winnie the Pooh pictures adds little to the photo</td>', 'The posed snapshot does not really jump out at me saying Fun.  The space with the Winnie the Pooh pictures adds little to the photo', '2008-10-08 02:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998389, 728626, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea.  Background is good (would have been nie if the other kids were not there).  Not sure what Shutter speed you had, but the foreground kids could have been a little sharper to really make them jump out of the background.  Finding the balance for shutter speed (sharp front but blurred back) is hard for these.  Maybe speeding up the spin and quicker shutter may have given that better effect.<br/>However, great idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice Idea.  Background is good (would have been nie if the other kids were not there).  Not sure what Shutter speed you had, but the foreground kids could have been a little sharper to really make them jump out of the background.  Finding the balance for shutter speed (sharp front but blurred back) is hard for these.  Maybe speeding up the spin and quicker shutter may have given that better effect.However, great idea for the challenge.', '2008-10-08 02:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998391, 729245, 96881, '<td valign="top">The crop is great, except that once dice is cut off.  Agree that a shallow depth of field is the way to go, but maybe this was a little too shallow.  The die could have been a little sharper and therefore the background blurred but not as much as it is now.</td>', 'The crop is great, except that once dice is cut off.  Agree that a shallow depth of field is the way to go, but maybe this was a little too shallow.  The die could have been a little sharper and therefore the background blurred but not as much as it is now.', '2008-10-08 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4998401, 729255, 94601, '<td valign="top">great picture. really creative and well executed!</td>', 'great picture. really creative and well executed!', '2008-10-08 03:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
