(4999438, 729118, 97313, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, nice waves.</td>', 'Nice landscape, nice waves.', '2008-10-08 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999440, 729063, 99348, '<td valign="top">don''t usually like fishing pics...but this one is well captured.</td>', 'don''t usually like fishing pics...but this one is well captured.', '2008-10-08 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999441, 729126, 99348, '<td valign="top">nice.</td>', 'nice.', '2008-10-08 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999442, 729245, 99350, '<td valign="top">I really like how the dice were captured on edge. I gives the photo a dynamic quality. It makes me feel like someone is actually playing the game (even though there are no people present in the frame), whereas if they were static, it might convey a feeling of vacancy, which does not imply ''playing''. I like the choice of black and white - makes it more dramatic.</td>', 'I really like how the dice were captured on edge. I gives the photo a dynamic quality. It makes me feel like someone is actually playing the game (even though there are no people present in the frame), whereas if they were static, it might convey a feeling of vacancy, which does not imply ''playing''. I like the choice of black and white - makes it more dramatic.', '2008-10-08 13:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999446, 728933, 99348, '<td valign="top">I like.</td>', 'I like.', '2008-10-08 13:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999448, 729087, 99348, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see more that just a silhouette.</td>', 'Wish I could see more that just a silhouette.', '2008-10-08 13:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999457, 728809, 97313, '<td valign="top">I think you shouldn''t have cut the image in 2 parts, maybe more 1/3 sky orr water.</td>', 'I think you shouldn''t have cut the image in 2 parts, maybe more 1/3 sky orr water.', '2008-10-08 13:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999458, 729231, 99350, '<td valign="top">If this person isn''t just posing, he is really ''playing''. Nice job of meeting the challenge.</td>', 'If this person isn''t just posing, he is really ''playing''. Nice job of meeting the challenge.', '2008-10-08 13:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999462, 728995, 97313, '<td valign="top">A closer picture would probably make it very cute !</td>', 'A closer picture would probably make it very cute !', '2008-10-08 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999473, 728935, 97313, '<td valign="top">Not the best weather/light for that picture. Same for the background.</td>', 'Not the best weather/light for that picture. Same for the background.', '2008-10-08 13:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999482, 729086, 99350, '<td valign="top">Great sports photography shot. This represents the theme of ''play'' well because all 4 atheletes are focused directly on the ball. This shows that all their heads are in the game. You did a good job of freezing the play at the right moment. Sometimes a little bit of blur can be the key to good action shots, but the fact that the girls are frozen in mid air gives the photo a dynamic quality.</td>', 'Great sports photography shot. This represents the theme of ''play'' well because all 4 atheletes are focused directly on the ball. This shows that all their heads are in the game. You did a good job of freezing the play at the right moment. Sometimes a little bit of blur can be the key to good action shots, but the fact that the girls are frozen in mid air gives the photo a dynamic quality.', '2008-10-08 13:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999489, 728600, 97313, '<td valign="top">I think it''s too much cut "in the middle". The landscape was probably worth taking 2/3 or something of the image.</td>', 'I think it''s too much cut "in the middle". The landscape was probably worth taking 2/3 or something of the image.', '2008-10-08 13:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999490, 729081, 97313, '<td valign="top">That''s cool !</td>', 'That''s cool !', '2008-10-08 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999507, 729314, 99350, '<td valign="top">This photo captures one of the most basic acts of play. The child''s action not only represents playing in the autumn leaves, but is analogous with children playing in other substances such as snow, ball pens at MacDonald''s or anything else they typically submerse themselves in and grab/throw up in the air using their hands. If I could picture any person having a great time playing (whatever that might be for them), they would have this child''s facial expression. Great job.</td>', 'This photo captures one of the most basic acts of play. The child''s action not only represents playing in the autumn leaves, but is analogous with children playing in other substances such as snow, ball pens at MacDonald''s or anything else they typically submerse themselves in and grab/throw up in the air using their hands. If I could picture any person having a great time playing (whatever that might be for them), they would have this child''s facial expression. Great job.', '2008-10-08 13:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999510, 728213, 97313, '<td valign="top">sorry for your loss. Not sure this has anything to do with the challenge tough.</td>', 'sorry for your loss. Not sure this has anything to do with the challenge tough.', '2008-10-08 13:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999542, 729313, 97313, '<td valign="top">Too dark and too much editing for me.</td>', 'Too dark and too much editing for me.', '2008-10-08 13:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999544, 729271, 99350, '<td valign="top">Great shot. This guy''s definitely playing. Interesting choice of cameral angle. Puts you more in the shoes of the rider than if it were taken straight on.</td>', 'Great shot. This guy''s definitely playing. Interesting choice of cameral angle. Puts you more in the shoes of the rider than if it were taken straight on.', '2008-10-08 13:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999545, 728574, 97313, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the black and white. The image feels like back in time.</td>', 'Nice work on the black and white. The image feels like back in time.', '2008-10-08 13:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999549, 729258, 97313, '<td valign="top">Nice, maybe it would have been better with more sky than water. Actually after checking your picture later, it''s quite fine like that.</td>', 'Nice, maybe it would have been better with more sky than water. Actually after checking your picture later, it''s quite fine like that.', '2008-10-08 13:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999550, 728625, 97313, '<td valign="top">Nice lights</td>', 'Nice lights', '2008-10-08 13:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999551, 729170, 97313, '<td valign="top">The subject is not isolated, not enough work on what''s around the computer I think.</td>', 'The subject is not isolated, not enough work on what''s around the computer I think.', '2008-10-08 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999552, 729084, 97313, '<td valign="top">The effect on the image is too strong, I''m assuming it''s a sport hall ?</td>', 'The effect on the image is too strong, I''m assuming it''s a sport hall ?', '2008-10-08 13:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999553, 729293, 97313, '<td valign="top">Too much too blurry for me.</td>', 'Too much too blurry for me.', '2008-10-08 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4999563, 729196, 99350, '<td valign="top">This presents an interesting commentary on the idea of work vs. play. Rhetorical question: When an action of play becomes work, does is cease being play, or should it be considered something in between? Can it be both?</td>', 'This presents an interesting commentary on the idea of work vs. play. Rhetorical question: When an action of play becomes work, does is cease being play, or should it be considered something in between? Can it be both?', '2008-10-08 13:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
