(5001575, 729009, 2490, '<td valign="top">This looks like a setup for a major fade, with the ball too far behind center of the stance.  :)  As a golfer , it would have felt more "right'' with the ball off the left heel, and thus more believable for me.  Still a good shot.  The green reflection off the bottom of the ball is interesting.  This is a "7" for me.</td>', 'This looks like a setup for a major fade, with the ball too far behind center of the stance.  :)  As a golfer , it would have felt more "right'' with the ball off the left heel, and thus more believable for me.  Still a good shot.  The green reflection off the bottom of the ball is interesting.  This is a "7" for me.', '2008-10-09 13:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001576, 729162, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow, and barefoot, too. I''m impressed.  Or scared, one. :)</td>', 'Wow, and barefoot, too. I''m impressed.  Or scared, one. :)', '2008-10-09 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001578, 729308, 2490, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot that I think would have had more "kick" if you could have somehow gotten more light into the eyes and not quite so much on the mask.</td>', 'Interesting shot that I think would have had more "kick" if you could have somehow gotten more light into the eyes and not quite so much on the mask.', '2008-10-09 13:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001580, 728325, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s impressive.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s impressive.', '2008-10-09 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001582, 728574, 2490, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus could have been on the little guy in the middle instead of the hay on the left.</td>', 'I wish the focus could have been on the little guy in the middle instead of the hay on the left.', '2008-10-09 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001586, 729329, 2490, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of the face.</td>', 'I like the framing of the face.', '2008-10-09 13:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5001594, 729276, 2490, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  A little "gray", for some reason.  Needs some true white.  It''s also interesting how the ring grabs my eye so easily.  It''s at the "thirds" point, and it''s also a bright spot.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  A little "gray", for some reason.  Needs some true white.  It''s also interesting how the ring grabs my eye so easily.  It''s at the "thirds" point, and it''s also a bright spot.', '2008-10-09 13:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
