(5001760, 729165, 99384, '<td valign="top">This is really fantastic! Wonderfully sharp subject,with her surrounding whizzing by! Perfect exposure and framing! Brings back good memories of ealier days playing in the park.</td>', 'This is really fantastic! Wonderfully sharp subject,with her surrounding whizzing by! Perfect exposure and framing! Brings back good memories of ealier days playing in the park.', '2008-10-09 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
