(5005703, 728583, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would prefer to see this in colour, as then the players stand out more from the background.  Good capture.  Player kicking the ball is sharp while the slightly blurred ball gives the impression of movement</td>', 'Would prefer to see this in colour, as then the players stand out more from the background.  Good capture.  Player kicking the ball is sharp while the slightly blurred ball gives the impression of movement', '2008-10-12 22:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
