(5005707, 729034, 96881, '<td valign="top">Terrific colours in this shot.  The Red makes him stand out without him being too large in the photo, and it works well.  Don''t like the title (it doesn''t say play where the photo does) but I will ignore it as its a photographic competition</td>', 'Terrific colours in this shot.  The Red makes him stand out without him being too large in the photo, and it works well.  Don''t like the title (it doesn''t say play where the photo does) but I will ignore it as its a photographic competition', '2008-10-12 22:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
