(5008835, 729295, 96881, '<td valign="top">Sorry to hear about Ricky.<br/>I thought this would place higher, make the top 10 for sure.  Sometimes I think voters kill a picture for the small technical issues (slight overexposed tennis balls) and do not realise what difficulty there might have been to change that.  I pose in this picture is priceless, and I know how hard it is to work with more than one animal at once.  And hey, if that German Sheppard deceides to lie too close to the bakcdrop, their ain''t much you can do about it.<br/>Congrats on a great photo of Ricky and Lucy!</td>', 'Sorry to hear about Ricky.I thought this would place higher, make the top 10 for sure.  Sometimes I think voters kill a picture for the small technical issues (slight overexposed tennis balls) and do not realise what difficulty there might have been to change that.  I pose in this picture is priceless, and I know how hard it is to work with more than one animal at once.  And hey, if that German Sheppard deceides to lie too close to the bakcdrop, their ain''t much you can do about it.Congrats on a great photo of Ricky and Lucy!', '2008-10-15 01:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
