(5009056, 728459, 68237, '<td valign="top">Love the shot but i''d like to see more shadow details in his pants and hair. If you re edit and make a second adjustment layer you should be able to find a nice balance and I think it would work for the image.</td>', 'Love the shot but i''d like to see more shadow details in his pants and hair. If you re edit and make a second adjustment layer you should be able to find a nice balance and I think it would work for the image.', '2008-10-15 04:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
